uestion-shaped H2s so each section can be retrieved independently by a search or AI system.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">4</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Evidence</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Tables, data points, screenshots and named sources — the things models prefer to cite.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">5</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Action</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">A next step that fits the reader&#x27;s stage, not a hard sell on an informational query.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">6</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">FAQ</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Six to ten page-specific questions with FAQPage schema attached.</span></span></li></ol></div><div class="rounded-xl border-l-4 border-amber bg-amber/10 p-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:240:11"><p class="font-display font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:241:13">Editorial standard</p><p class="mt-1 text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:242:13">No filler introductions, no &#x27;in today&#x27;s fast-paced world&#x27;, no invented statistics. Every claim is either sourced, measurable or removed.</p></div></div></section><section id="conversion" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Copywriting for conversion, not just traffic</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">A page that ranks and never converts is an expensive hobby. Service and landing copy is written from your buyer&#x27;s objections outward: what they are worried about, what proof settles it, what the price signal is, and what happens after they enquire. We interview your sales team before writing anything commercial.</p><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:132:13"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:133:31">What we change most often on existing pages</h3><ul class="space-y-2" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:134:15"><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Headlines that describe the company instead of the customer&#x27;s outcome</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Missing price signals, which drive the highest-intent visitors to bounce and compare</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Proof buried at the bottom of the page instead of beside the claim</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Forms asking for eight fields when three would do</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">No answer to the obvious next question, forcing a return to search</span></li></ul></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-14" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/PageTemplate.tsx:136:13"><div id="faqs" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:289:5"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:290:7">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card px-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:293:7" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:295:11"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-tsd-source="/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx:21:3"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_3diiq_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-display text-base font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:296:13" data-radix-collection-item="">How much do you charge per article?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height